\ HCRITICA.SEQ  Critical error handler                  F-PC native port

\ The original installed an INT 24h handler so DOS "Abort, Retry, Fail?"
\ errors simply failed. The host OS reports I/O errors as error codes, so
\ there is nothing to install.

VARIABLE HADCRITICAL        \ non-zero if critcal error has happened

: SETCRITICAL   ( -- ) ;
